# Supabase — optional remote admin backend
# Get these from your Supabase dashboard: Project Settings → API Keys
# Project URL looks like:  https://xxxx.supabase.co
# Use the PUBLISHABLE key (sb_publishable_...) — the modern replacement for the anon key.
# It is safe to share publicly; Row Level Security (RLS) protects your data.
# If you don't want to use .env, you can paste these two values directly
# into src/config.ts (SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY) instead.
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=